  "name": "Armor Reversion",
  "slug": "armor-reversion",
  "teaser": "Changes the hitboxes of armor plates so that they now fully cover the thorax and stomach, as well as the front and back.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2133.jpg",
  "downloads": 1295,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<p>First and foremost, the code for this mod came from the Sakura_Yuki’s “<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1871-gearprotection/?highlight=prot#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GearProtection</a>” mod (i.e. they are the original author), so show’em some love!</p>\n<p>With that out of the way, this mod changes the hitboxes/ colliders of armor plates so that they cover the following areas:<br />\n- Thorax (ribcage_upper)</p>\n<p>- Stomach (ribcage_lower)</p>\n<p>- Upper back (spine_upper)</p>\n<p>- Lower back (spine_lower)</p>\n<p>This mod is intended for people who want the hitbox changes introduced in the 3.9.0 update but don’t want to update to 3.9.0 (like me).</p>\n",
